#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:2
msgid "The frame buffer viewer"
msgstr "Preglednik međuspremnika slike"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:4
msgid ""
"The frame buffer viewer shows what the camera sees -- more precisely, "
"whatever the running script last left in the camera's frame buffer. Every "
":meth:`~csi.CSI.snapshot` puts a fresh capture there, and everything the "
"script draws on the image afterwards is there too, so the preview shows the "
"frame *after* the script's processing, annotations included. The IDE polls "
"the camera for the latest frame over USB and displays each one as it "
"arrives."
msgstr ""
"Preglednik međuspremnika slike prikazuje što kamera vidi -- točnije, ono što"
" je pokrenuta skripta posljednje ostavila u međuspremniku slike kamere. "
"Svaki :meth:`~csi.CSI.snapshot` tamo stavlja svježu snimku, a tamo je i sve "
"što skripta nakon toga nacrta na slici, pa pregled prikazuje sličicu *nakon*"
" obrade skripte, uključujući napomene. IDE ispituje kameru za najnoviju "
"sličicu putem USB-a i prikazuje svaku kako pristiže."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:14
msgid ""
"The frame buffer pane showing a live thermal image, its title reading Frame "
"Buffer (JPEG) with the resolution and focus number, the Record and Zoom "
"buttons and the source and streaming-mode selectors in the title bar, and "
"the RGB histogram of the frame below"
msgstr ""
"Okno međuspremnika slike koje prikazuje termalnu sliku uživo, s naslovom "
"Frame Buffer (JPEG) s razlučivošću i brojem fokusa, gumbima Record i Zoom te"
" biračima izvora i načina strujanja u naslovnoj traci, i RGB histogramom "
"sličice ispod"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:14
msgid ".. image:: figures/frame-buffer.png"
msgstr ".. image:: figures/frame-buffer.png"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:18
msgid ""
"The frame buffer showing a thermal camera's output. The title reads off the "
"frame format, resolution, and focus number; the histogram below plots the "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"Međuspremnik slike koji prikazuje izlaz termalne kamere. Naslov očitava "
"format sličice, razlučivost i broj fokusa; histogram ispod iscrtava sličicu."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:23
msgid ""
"The preview costs something: compressing and streaming each frame takes "
"camera time, so a script generally runs faster with the IDE disconnected "
"than with the preview live. The pane's title-bar buttons manage that trade-"
"off:"
msgstr ""
"Pregled nešto košta: kompresiranje i strujanje svake sličice oduzima vrijeme"
" kamere, pa skripta općenito radi brže s odspojenim IDE-om nego s pregledom "
"uživo. Gumbi u naslovnoj traci okna upravljaju tim kompromisom:"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:29
msgid ""
"*Zoom* -- scale the image to fit the pane (on by default). Off, the image "
"renders at one screen pixel per image pixel."
msgstr ""
"*Zoom* -- skalira sliku da stane u okno (uključeno prema zadanom). "
"Isključeno, slika se prikazuje s jednim pikselom zaslona po pikselu slike."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:32
msgid ""
"The *source* selector -- which sensor streams to the IDE, or *Off* to stop "
"streaming frames entirely for maximum camera-side performance. On a camera "
"with one image sensor the choice is simply *On* or *Off*; a camera with more"
" than one -- a main sensor and a thermal or event sensor, say -- lists each "
"by name, and the frame buffer follows whichever you pick, independently of "
"which one the script is reading. With the source off the script keeps "
"running and the preview freezes on the last frame behind a \"Frame Buffer "
"Off\" banner until you turn it back on. Use it when benchmarking, since the "
"FPS the script achieves with the preview off is the FPS it will achieve "
"standalone."
msgstr ""
"Birač *izvora* -- koji senzor struji u IDE, ili *Isključeno* za potpuno "
"zaustavljanje strujanja sličica radi maksimalne izvedbe na strani kamere. Na"
" kameri s jednim slikovnim senzorom izbor je jednostavno *Uključeno* ili "
"*Isključeno*; kamera s više od jednog -- recimo glavni senzor i termalni "
"senzor ili senzor događaja -- navodi svaki po imenu, a međuspremnik slike "
"prati onaj koji odaberete, neovisno o tome koji skripta čita. S isključenim "
"izvorom skripta i dalje radi, a pregled se zamrzava na posljednjoj sličici "
"iza natpisa \"Frame Buffer Off\" dok ga ponovno ne uključite. Koristite ga "
"pri mjerenju izvedbe, jer je FPS koji skripta postiže s isključenim "
"pregledom FPS koji će postići samostalno."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:46
msgid ""
"*JPG Mode / RAW Mode* -- whether frames are JPEG compressed for the trip to "
"the IDE or sent uncompressed. The mode starts out at whichever the connected"
" camera prefers -- JPG for most. JPG mode is much faster; RAW mode shows the"
" exact pixel values at the cost of frame rate."
msgstr ""
"*JPG Mode / RAW Mode* -- jesu li sličice JPEG komprimirane za put do IDE-a "
"ili poslane nekomprimirane. Način rada počinje s onim koji povezana kamera "
"preferira -- JPG za većinu. JPG način mnogo je brži; RAW način prikazuje "
"točne vrijednosti piksela na račun broja sličica."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:53
msgid ""
"The pane's title is also its readout. Once frames are arriving it reads "
"*Frame Buffer (JPEG)* -- or the pixel format of a raw stream -- followed by "
"the resolution of the displayed image and the focus number described with "
"the :doc:`histogram <histogram>`."
msgstr ""
"Naslov okna ujedno je i njegovo očitanje. Kad sličice stižu, glasi *Frame "
"Buffer (JPEG)* -- ili format piksela sirovog toka -- nakon čega slijedi "
"razlučivost prikazane slike i broj fokusa opisan uz :doc:`histogram "
"<histogram>`."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:60
msgid "Selecting a region"
msgstr "Odabir područja"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:62
msgid ""
"Click and drag on the image to select a rectangular region. While a "
"selection exists, the histogram below computes its statistics from the "
"selected pixels only, and the title's readout adds the selection's position,"
" size, and pixel count -- the quickest way to read off an ROI tuple for a "
"script, or to measure the colour statistics of one object instead of the "
"whole scene. Click without dragging to read off a single pixel's position; "
"click outside the image to clear the selection."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite i povucite po slici da biste odabrali pravokutno područje. Dok "
"odabir postoji, histogram ispod računa svoju statistiku samo iz odabranih "
"piksela, a očitanje u naslovu dodaje položaj, veličinu i broj piksela "
"odabira -- najbrži način da očitate n-torku ROI-ja za skriptu ili da "
"izmjerite statistiku boje jednog objekta umjesto cijele scene. Kliknite bez "
"povlačenja da biste očitali položaj jednog piksela; kliknite izvan slike da "
"biste poništili odabir."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:74
msgid "Saving what the camera sees"
msgstr "Spremanje onoga što kamera vidi"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/frame-buffer.rst:76
msgid ""
"Right-click the image to save the displayed frame to an image file on your "
"computer. The save respects the selection: right-click inside a selected "
"region and just that region is saved (the menu entry reads \"Save Image "
"selection to PC\"); right-click anywhere else and the whole frame is saved. "
"What lands on disk is the frame shown at the moment you right-click -- to "
"capture one exact frame from a moving scene, stop the script first so the "
"preview freezes on it."
msgstr ""
"Desnom tipkom kliknite sliku da biste spremili prikazanu sličicu u datoteku "
"slike na svom računalu. Spremanje poštuje odabir: kliknite desnom tipkom "
"unutar odabranog područja i sprema se samo to područje (stavka izbornika "
"glasi \"Save Image selection to PC\"); kliknite desnom tipkom bilo gdje "
"drugdje i sprema se cijela sličica. Ono što završi na disku je sličica "
"prikazana u trenutku kada kliknete desnom tipkom -- da biste snimili jednu "
"točnu sličicu iz scene koja se kreće, prvo zaustavite skriptu kako bi se "
"pregled na njoj zamrznuo."

